            ("Do I need to finish every administrative task in the first week?", "No. Complete time-sensitive official duties first, then work through phone, banking, and convenience services in dependency order. Some accounts cannot be completed until another document or address is ready."),
            ("Is mobile data enough for a working holiday?", "It is enough for maps and messaging, but some local services require a Korean phone number or SMS verification. Decide based on the accounts you actually need rather than the cheapest data allowance."),
            ("Can my hostel address be used everywhere?", "It depends on the service and your current official requirements. Ask the hostel for the full address and confirm with the receiving office or company before relying on temporary accommodation paperwork."),
