            ("Why did one receipt fail at the kiosk?", "The record may involve eligibility, data, operator, timing, or validation issues. Note the exact message and use the support route named on that transaction instead of repeatedly scanning every receipt."),
            ("How long should I keep the documents?", "Keep them until the refund has settled and any customs question is finished. A reference number and receipt are much more useful than a bank statement with an unexplained amount."),
