            "Room category names do not guarantee the features you picture. Confirm bed size and count, private versus shared bathroom, window, floor, elevator, luggage storage, heating or cooling control, laundry, kitchen access, and whether photos show the exact room type. Ask for written clarification when a feature affects health or mobility.",
            "Booking conditions matter as much as nightly price. Compare taxes, cleaning or service charges, deposit, payment timing, cancellation time zone, no-show rule, late check-in, front-desk hours, guest restrictions, and address details. A cheap nonrefundable room is expensive if the flight or visa plan is uncertain.",
